   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADCOSAI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SADCOSAI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADCOSAI is an organisation with SADC&apos;s general auditors as members. The head quarter is located in Pretoria and the objective is to increase the auditing capacity by training and standardisation work within the SADC region. To achieve the aim increased responsibility and openness in the management of public funds contributing to good governance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SADCOSAI &#xE4;r en organisation med SADCs riksrevisorer som medlemmar. Sekretariatet finns i Pretoria och m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningen &#xE4;r att genom utbildning och normarbete h&#xF6;ja revisionskapaciteten inom revisions- myndigheterna i SADC-regionen n&#xE5; m&#xE5;let &#xF6;kad ansvarighet och &#xF6;ppenhet i hanteringen av allm&#xE4;nna medel vilket bidrar till god samh&#xE4;llstyrning.</narrative>
  </description>
